      ['On the seventh day Diyor felt different. The [trendy] apps were [user-friendly], but the village was calmer. He remembered laughing for the first time in weeks. He stayed [in the loop|in the loop] with family, and he stopped [endlessly|endlessly] scrolling. When his post about the village [blew up|blow up], he smiled, but he did not check the numbers. “Not everything that is [clickbait] needs a click,” he said. And that night, he put the phone away and looked at the stars.',
       'Yettinchi kuni Diyor o‘zini boshqacha his qildi. Ommabop ilovalar foydalanishga qulay edi, lekin qishloq xotirjamroq edi. U haftalar ichida birinchi marta kulganini esladi. U oila bilan xabardor bo‘lib turdi va cheksiz varaqlashni to‘xtatdi. Qishloq haqidagi posti tez tarqalganda u jilmaydi, lekin raqamlarni tekshirmadi. «Qiziqtiruvchi soxta sarlavhalarning hammasiga bosish shart emas», dedi u. O‘sha kechasi u telefonni qo‘yib, yulduzlarga qaradi.']
